{"title":"WebSocket/SSE/Netty","uid":"d363cba6965a256094a1367b49bb4c6e","slug":"WebSocket-SSE-Netty","date":"2025-11-26T13:47:21.000Z","updated":"2025-11-26T13:59:12.100Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/WebSocket-SSE-Netty.json","keywords":"VUE、Python、JAVA","cover":"/medias/wltx.png","content":"<h1 id=\"WebSocket-SSE-Netty-对比与聊天室实践笔记（Spring-Boot-Vue3）\"><a href=\"#WebSocket-SSE-Netty-对比与聊天室实践笔记（Spring-Boot-Vue3）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"WebSocket &#x2F; SSE &#x2F; Netty 对比与聊天室实践笔记（Spring Boot + Vue3）\"></a>WebSocket &#x2F; SSE &#x2F; Netty 对比与聊天室实践笔记（Spring Boot + Vue3）</h1><h2 id=\"1-基础概念回顾\"><a href=\"#1-基础概念回顾\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1. 基础概念回顾\"></a>1. 基础概念回顾</h2><h3 id=\"1-1-WebSocket\"><a href=\"#1-1-WebSocket\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1.1 WebSocket\"></a>1.1 WebSocket</h3><p><strong>基于 TCP 的全双工长连接协议，最适合实时双向通信（聊天室、在线游戏、协同编辑）。</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>通过 HTTP 握手升级协议（<code>Upgrade: websocket</code>）</li>\n<li>升级后使用 WebSocket 帧双向通信</li>\n<li>客户端 &amp; 服务端都可主动发送消息</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"1-2-SSE（Server-Sent-Events）\"><a href=\"#1-2-SSE（Server-Sent-Events）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1.2 SSE（Server-Sent Events）\"></a>1.2 SSE（Server-Sent Events）</h3><p><strong>基于 HTTP 的服务器 → 客户端单向推送机制。</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>客户端使用 <code>EventSource</code> 建立长连接</li>\n<li>服务端持续推送 <code>text/event-stream</code> 格式文本</li>\n<li>客户端发送消息需使用额外 HTTP 接口</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"1-3-Netty\"><a href=\"#1-3-Netty\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"1.3 Netty\"></a>1.3 Netty</h3><p><strong>Java NIO 高性能网络通信框架（不是协议）。</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>可以在上面实现 HTTP、WebSocket、自定义二进制协议</li>\n<li>性能高、可处理大量长连接</li>\n<li>开发门槛更高，更偏底层</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"2-三者对比表\"><a href=\"#2-三者对比表\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"2. 三者对比表\"></a>2. 三者对比表</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>WebSocket</th>\n<th>SSE</th>\n<th>Netty</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>本质</td>\n<td>基于 TCP 的全双工协议</td>\n<td>基于 HTTP 的单向推送</td>\n<td>Java NIO 网络框架</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通信方向</td>\n<td>双工（Client ⇆ Server）</td>\n<td>单向（Server → Client）</td>\n<td>自定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>是否长连接</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>可长可短</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浏览器原生支持</td>\n<td><code>WebSocket</code></td>\n<td><code>EventSource</code></td>\n<td>无（需上层协议）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>客户端发消息</td>\n<td>可以</td>\n<td>不行（需额外 HTTP）</td>\n<td>自定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务端推消息</td>\n<td>可以</td>\n<td>可以</td>\n<td>自定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文本 &#x2F; 二进制</td>\n<td>都支持</td>\n<td>文本为主（可 JSON）</td>\n<td>自定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现复杂度</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型场景</td>\n<td>聊天室、协同、游戏</td>\n<td>通知流、看板</td>\n<td>网关、自定义协议 IM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对 Vue 聊天室适配度</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td>\n<td>⭐⭐✩✩✩</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐⭐✩</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"3-架构图（ASCII-文字版）\"><a href=\"#3-架构图（ASCII-文字版）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3. 架构图（ASCII 文字版）\"></a>3. 架构图（ASCII 文字版）</h2><h3 id=\"3-1-WebSocket-架构（仅-Spring-Boot）\"><a href=\"#3-1-WebSocket-架构（仅-Spring-Boot）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3.1 WebSocket 架构（仅 Spring Boot）\"></a>3.1 WebSocket 架构（仅 Spring Boot）</h3><figure class=\"highlight js\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">[ 浏览器 / <span class=\"title class_\">Vue3</span> ]</span><br><span class=\"line\">        |</span><br><span class=\"line\">        | <span class=\"number\">1.</span> <span class=\"variable constant_\">HTTP</span> 握手（<span class=\"title class_\">Upgrade</span>: websocket）</span><br><span class=\"line\">        v</span><br><span class=\"line\">[ <span class=\"title class_\">Spring</span> <span class=\"title class_\">Boot</span> <span class=\"title class_\">WebSocket</span> 端点 ]</span><br><span class=\"line\">        |</span><br><span class=\"line\">        | <span class=\"number\">2.</span> <span class=\"title class_\">WebSocket</span> 长连接 (双向收发消息)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        v</span><br><span class=\"line\">[ 业务服务 / 消息分发 / <span class=\"title class_\">Redis</span> / <span class=\"variable constant_\">MQ</span> 等 ]</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"3-2-SSE-架构\"><a href=\"#3-2-SSE-架构\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3.2 SSE 架构\"></a>3.2 SSE 架构</h3><figure class=\"highlight js\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">[ 浏览器 / <span class=\"title class_\">Vue3</span> ]</span><br><span class=\"line\">        |</span><br><span class=\"line\">        | <span class=\"number\">1.</span> <span class=\"title class_\">EventSource</span> 发起 <span class=\"variable constant_\">HTTP</span> 请求</span><br><span class=\"line\">        v</span><br><span class=\"line\">[ <span class=\"title class_\">Spring</span> <span class=\"title class_\">Boot</span> <span class=\"variable constant_\">SSE</span> <span class=\"title class_\">Endpoint</span> (text/event-stream)]</span><br><span class=\"line\">        |</span><br><span class=\"line\">        | <span class=\"number\">2.</span> 单向事件流推送 (<span class=\"title class_\">Server</span> -&gt; <span class=\"title class_\">Client</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        v</span><br><span class=\"line\">[ 实时通知 / 系统事件 / 广播消息 ]</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"3-3-引入-Netty-作为底层长连接服务（进阶）\"><a href=\"#3-3-引入-Netty-作为底层长连接服务（进阶）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"3.3 引入 Netty 作为底层长连接服务（进阶）\"></a>3.3 引入 Netty 作为底层长连接服务（进阶）</h3><figure class=\"highlight js\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">[ 浏览器 / 移动端 / 其他客户端 ]</span><br><span class=\"line\">         |</span><br><span class=\"line\">         |  <span class=\"title class_\">WebSocket</span> / <span class=\"variable constant_\">HTTP</span> / 自定义协议</span><br><span class=\"line\">         v</span><br><span class=\"line\">[ <span class=\"title class_\">Netty</span> 长连接服务器 ]</span><br><span class=\"line\">         |</span><br><span class=\"line\">         |  内部 <span class=\"variable constant_\">RPC</span> / <span class=\"variable constant_\">MQ</span> / <span class=\"variable constant_\">HTTP</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">         v</span><br><span class=\"line\">[ <span class=\"title class_\">Spring</span> <span class=\"title class_\">Boot</span> 业务服务集群 ]</span><br><span class=\"line\">         |</span><br><span class=\"line\">         v</span><br><span class=\"line\">[ 数据库 / <span class=\"title class_\">Redis</span> / 其他中间件 ]</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"4-从“简单-WebSocket-聊天室”到“Netty-IM-网关”的演进示意\"><a href=\"#4-从“简单-WebSocket-聊天室”到“Netty-IM-网关”的演进示意\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4. 从“简单 WebSocket 聊天室”到“Netty IM 网关”的演进示意\"></a>4. 从“简单 WebSocket 聊天室”到“Netty IM 网关”的演进示意</h2><p>这一部分侧重 <strong>架构演进思路</strong>，不是要你一次性全上，而是帮你看清未来怎么升级。</p>\n<h3 id=\"4-1-阶段一：单体-WebSocket-聊天室（入门阶段）\"><a href=\"#4-1-阶段一：单体-WebSocket-聊天室（入门阶段）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.1 阶段一：单体 WebSocket 聊天室（入门阶段）\"></a>4.1 阶段一：单体 WebSocket 聊天室（入门阶段）</h3><figure class=\"highlight js\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">[ <span class=\"title class_\">Vue3</span> 前端 ]  &lt;--- <span class=\"title class_\">WebSocket</span> ---&gt;  [ <span class=\"title class_\">Spring</span> <span class=\"title class_\">Boot</span> 应用 (含 <span class=\"title class_\">WebSocket</span>) ]  ---&gt;  [ <span class=\"title class_\">MySQL</span> / <span class=\"title class_\">Redis</span> ]</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>特点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>一切都在一个 Spring Boot 应用里</li>\n<li>适合学习和小规模用户</li>\n<li>水平扩展时需要处理 Session 粘滞、消息广播同步（可接入 Redis Pub&#x2F;Sub）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"4-2-阶段二：拆出“消息层”（仍然只有-Spring-Boot）\"><a href=\"#4-2-阶段二：拆出“消息层”（仍然只有-Spring-Boot）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.2 阶段二：拆出“消息层”（仍然只有 Spring Boot）\"></a>4.2 阶段二：拆出“消息层”（仍然只有 Spring Boot）</h3><figure class=\"highlight js\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">[ <span class=\"title class_\">Vue3</span> 前端 ]  &lt;--- <span class=\"title class_\">WebSocket</span> ---&gt;  [ <span class=\"title class_\">Spring</span> <span class=\"title class_\">Boot</span> <span class=\"title class_\">WebSocket</span> 接入层 ]</span><br><span class=\"line\">                                       |</span><br><span class=\"line\">                                       |  <span class=\"variable constant_\">MQ</span> / <span class=\"title class_\">Redis</span> <span class=\"title class_\">PubSub</span> / <span class=\"variable constant_\">HTTP</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">                                       v</span><br><span class=\"line\">                              [ <span class=\"title class_\">Spring</span> <span class=\"title class_\">Boot</span> 业务服务层 ]</span><br><span class=\"line\">                                       |</span><br><span class=\"line\">                                       v</span><br><span class=\"line\">                                  [ <span class=\"variable constant_\">DB</span> / <span class=\"title class_\">Redis</span> ]</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>特点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>WebSocket 接入层专注长连接 &amp; 推送</li>\n<li>业务服务层专注业务逻辑、存储</li>\n<li>为将来用 Netty 替换接入层打基础</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"4-3-阶段三：引入-Netty-作为-IM-网关\"><a href=\"#4-3-阶段三：引入-Netty-作为-IM-网关\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.3 阶段三：引入 Netty 作为 IM 网关\"></a>4.3 阶段三：引入 Netty 作为 IM 网关</h3><figure class=\"highlight js\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">[ <span class=\"title class_\">Vue3</span> / <span class=\"title class_\">App</span> / 其他客户端 ]</span><br><span class=\"line\">           |</span><br><span class=\"line\">           | <span class=\"title class_\">WebSocket</span> / 自定义协议</span><br><span class=\"line\">           v</span><br><span class=\"line\">      [ <span class=\"title class_\">Netty</span> <span class=\"variable constant_\">IM</span> 网关集群 ]</span><br><span class=\"line\">           |</span><br><span class=\"line\">           | <span class=\"number\">1.</span> 内部 <span class=\"variable constant_\">RPC</span> / <span class=\"variable constant_\">HTTP</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">           | <span class=\"number\">2.</span> <span class=\"variable constant_\">MQ</span> / <span class=\"title class_\">Redis</span> <span class=\"title class_\">Stream</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">           v</span><br><span class=\"line\">      [ <span class=\"title class_\">Spring</span> <span class=\"title class_\">Boot</span> 业务服务集群 ]</span><br><span class=\"line\">           |</span><br><span class=\"line\">           v</span><br><span class=\"line\">      [ <span class=\"title class_\">MySQL</span> / <span class=\"title class_\">Redis</span> / <span class=\"variable constant_\">ES</span> / ... ]</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<p>特点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Netty 网关负责：  <ul>\n<li>保持大量长连接  </li>\n<li>做协议编解码（WebSocket &#x2F; 二进制自定义协议）  </li>\n<li>做连接路由、在线状态管理</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Spring Boot 专注业务：  <ul>\n<li>会话、群聊、离线消息、推送规则等</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>对前端而言：<ul>\n<li>依然只需要 WebSocket 接入，无需感知底层已从“Spring Boot WebSocket”升级到“Netty 网关”</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"4-4-演进中的关键改造点\"><a href=\"#4-4-演进中的关键改造点\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"4.4 演进中的关键改造点\"></a>4.4 演进中的关键改造点</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>消息模型保持稳定</strong>  <ul>\n<li>例如统一采用 <code>ChatMessage</code> &#x2F; <code>SystemMessage</code> &#x2F; <code>AckMessage</code> 等 JSON 定义  </li>\n<li>未来 Netty 只需要按同样协议解码&#x2F;编码即可</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>业务与连接隔离</strong>  <ul>\n<li>越早把 WebSocket Handler 中的业务逻辑抽到 <code>ChatService</code> &#x2F; <code>MessageService</code> 等，越容易迁移  </li>\n<li>将“发送消息给所有在线用户”的逻辑抽象成接口：  <ul>\n<li>现在的实现：直接调用 <code>SessionManager.broadcast()</code>  </li>\n<li>未来实现：发到 MQ，由 Netty 网关或其他节点转发</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>引入消息中间件</strong>（可选但推荐）  <ul>\n<li>如 Redis Pub&#x2F;Sub、Kafka、RocketMQ 等  </li>\n<li>做跨节点消息同步、广播、削峰填谷</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"5-架构图（ASCII-文字版）\"><a href=\"#5-架构图（ASCII-文字版）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5. 架构图（ASCII 文字版）\"></a>5. 架构图（ASCII 文字版）</h2><h3 id=\"5-1-WebSocket-架构\"><a href=\"#5-1-WebSocket-架构\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.1 WebSocket 架构\"></a>5.1 WebSocket 架构</h3><figure class=\"highlight js\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">[ 浏览器 / <span class=\"title class_\">Vue3</span> ]</span><br><span class=\"line\">        |</span><br><span class=\"line\">        | <span class=\"number\">1.</span> <span class=\"variable constant_\">HTTP</span> 握手（<span class=\"title class_\">Upgrade</span>: websocket）</span><br><span class=\"line\">        v</span><br><span class=\"line\">[ <span class=\"title class_\">Spring</span> <span class=\"title class_\">Boot</span> <span class=\"title class_\">WebSocket</span> 端点 ]</span><br><span class=\"line\">        |</span><br><span class=\"line\">        | <span class=\"number\">2.</span> <span class=\"title class_\">WebSocket</span> 长连接 (双向)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        v</span><br><span class=\"line\">[ 业务服务 / 消息分发 / <span class=\"title class_\">Redis</span> / <span class=\"variable constant_\">MQ</span> 等 ]</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"5-2-SSE-架构\"><a href=\"#5-2-SSE-架构\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.2 SSE 架构\"></a>5.2 SSE 架构</h3><figure class=\"highlight js\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">[ 浏览器 / <span class=\"title class_\">Vue3</span> ]</span><br><span class=\"line\">        |</span><br><span class=\"line\">        | <span class=\"number\">1.</span> <span class=\"title class_\">EventSource</span> 发起 <span class=\"variable constant_\">HTTP</span> 请求</span><br><span class=\"line\">        v</span><br><span class=\"line\">[ <span class=\"title class_\">Spring</span> <span class=\"title class_\">Boot</span> <span class=\"variable constant_\">SSE</span> <span class=\"title class_\">Endpoint</span> (text/event-stream) ]</span><br><span class=\"line\">        |</span><br><span class=\"line\">        | <span class=\"number\">2.</span> 单向事件流推送 (<span class=\"title class_\">Server</span> -&gt; <span class=\"title class_\">Client</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">        v</span><br><span class=\"line\">[ 实时通知 / 系统事件 / 广播消息 ]</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n\n<h3 id=\"5-3-引入-Netty-作为底层长连接服务（进阶）\"><a href=\"#5-3-引入-Netty-作为底层长连接服务（进阶）\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"5.3 引入 Netty 作为底层长连接服务（进阶）\"></a>5.3 引入 Netty 作为底层长连接服务（进阶）</h3><figure class=\"highlight js\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">[ 浏览器 / 移动端 / 其他客户端 ]</span><br><span class=\"line\">              |</span><br><span class=\"line\">              |  <span class=\"title class_\">WebSocket</span> / <span class=\"variable constant_\">HTTP</span> / 自定义协议</span><br><span class=\"line\">              v</span><br><span class=\"line\">     [ <span class=\"title class_\">Netty</span> 长连接服务器 ]</span><br><span class=\"line\">              |</span><br><span class=\"line\">              |  内部 <span class=\"variable constant_\">RPC</span> / <span class=\"variable constant_\">MQ</span> / <span class=\"variable constant_\">HTTP</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">              v</span><br><span class